        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "cb392ae5-b587-5f88-af23-baade561c422",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Mafalda of Savoy, Victor Emmanuel III of Italy, Elena of Montenegro\n- Organizations: NGI\n- Places: Italy, Genoa, Buenos Aires, South America\n- Products: SS Principessa Mafalda\n\nFacts:\n- Victor Emmanuel III of Italy was born on 11 November 1869.\n- Victor Emmanuel III of Italy became King of Italy on 29 July 1900.\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy was born on 2 November 1902 as the second daughter of King Victor Emmanuel III of Italy and Elena of Montenegro.\n- In 1909, the SS Principessa Mafalda, named after Princess Mafalda of Savoy, entered NGI's South American service between Genoa and Buenos Aires.\n- Victor Emmanuel III of Italy abdicated on 9 May 1946.\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy died on 27 August 1944.\n- Victor Emmanuel III of Italy died on 28 December 1947.",
